, called the metric induced by <span class=\"math\" data-display=\"false\" data-tex=\"$F$\">$F$</span>.  <section class=\"theorem proof\"><div class=\"theorem-label\">Proof</div><p><a class=\"wikilink tex-use\" href=\"#node=references%2FLeeRiemannian%2Fblueprint%2Fsrc%2Fchapters%2Fchapter2%23lem%3Apseudo-pullback-form-symm\">↗ lem:pseudo-pullback-form-symm</a> <a class=\"wikilink tex-use\" href=\"#node=references%2FLeeRiemannian%2Fblueprint%2Fsrc%2Fchapters%2Fchapter2%23lem%3Apseudo-pullback-form-smooth\">↗ lem:pseudo-pullback-form-smooth</a> <a class=\"wikilink tex-use\" href=\"#node=references%2FLeeRiemannian%2Fblueprint%2Fsrc%2Fchapters%2Fchapter2%23def%3Apseudo-riemannian-metric\">↗ def:pseudo-riemannian-metric</a> <a class=\"wikilink tex-use\" href=\"#node=references%2FLeeRiemannian%2Fblueprint%2Fsrc%2Fchapters%2Fchapter2%23def%3Asmooth-field-scalar-products\">↗ def:smooth-field-scalar-products</a> \\sketch Lemmas <a class=\"reference tex-ref\" href=\"#node=references%2FLeeRiemannian%2Fblueprint%2Fsrc%2Fchapters%2Fchapter2%23lem%3Apseudo-pullback-form-symm\" data-tex-node=\"references/LeeRiemannian/blueprint/src/chapters/chapter2#lem:pseudo-pullback-form-symm\" data-tex-anchor=\"tex-label-6c656d3a70736575646f2d70756c6c6261636b2d666f726d2d73796d6d\">17</a> and <a class=\"reference tex-ref\" href=\"#node=references%2FLeeRiemannian%2Fblueprint%2Fsrc%2Fchapters%2Fchapter2%23lem%3Apseudo-pullback-form-smooth\" data-tex-node=\"references/LeeRiemannian/blueprint/src/chapters/chapter2#lem:pseudo-pullback-form-smooth\" data-tex-anchor=\"tex-label-6c656d3a70736575646f2d70756c6c6261636b2d666f726d2d736d6f6f7468\">17</a>, together with the nondegeneracy hypothesis, verify the three conditions of Definition <a class=\"reference tex-ref\" href=\"#node=references%2FLeeRiemannian%2Fblueprint%2Fsrc%2Fchapters%2Fchapter2%23def%3Asmooth-field-scalar-products\" data-tex-node=\"references/LeeRiemannian/blueprint/src/chapters/chapter2#def:smooth-field-scalar-products\" data-tex-ancho